  "body": "## Summary\n\n[#34](https://github.com/nelsong6/kill-me/pull/34) deleted \\`tofu/oauth.tf\\` (the \\`azuread_application.microsoft_login\\` resource) but left two stale references in tofu that made \\`tofu plan\\` fail on main with \\\"Reference to undeclared resource\\\":\n\n- \\`tofu/outputs.tf\\` \\`microsoft_login_client_id\\` output referenced \\`azuread_application.microsoft_login.client_id\\`\n- \\`tofu/main.tf\\` \\`front_app_dns_name\\` local (its callers were the deleted oauth.tf, appconfig.tf, and app_config_prefix output)\n\nAlso drops the \\`app_config_prefix\\` output since its dependency went too.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] \\`tofu / Plan\\` check now passes (no orphan references)\n- [ ] \\`spacelift/kill-me\\` either clears or stays at the pre-existing failure",
